  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation Technical Assistance to Support Programme for the Transformation of the Wine and Spirits Sector in South Africa - Including Marketing and Distribution</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;This service is to provide technical support to the Department of Agriculture, Land Reform and Rural Development, Land Bank, and National Agricultural Marketing Council to draft and finalise respective memoranda of understanding for the transformation and marketing and distribution components of the Support Programme for the Transformation of the Wine and Spirits Sector in South Africa - Including Marketing and Distribution.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
